
### List all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

###

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana",
    "studyHours": 5
}

###

### Get a student
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

###

### Update a student
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana",
    "studyHours": 8
}

###

### Delete a student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/1

###

### Predict student performance
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1/prediction


###

### List subjects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

###

### Create a subject
POST http://localhost:80£80/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Algoritmos",
    "difficulty": "MEDIUM"
}

###

### Create a student enrolled in subject 1
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana",
    "studyHours": 5,
    "enrollments": [
        { "subjectId": 1, "studyHours": 12 }
    ]
}

###

### Predict student performance for one subject
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1/subjects/1/prediction